00:38:27,660 --> 00:38:28,381
You can't go in.

881
00:38:28,821 --> 00:38:29,821
You really can't go in.

882
00:38:30,301 --> 00:38:31,100
You can't go in.

883
00:38:31,220 --> 00:38:31,740
Ms. Hui?

884
00:38:31,981 --> 00:38:32,660
Why are you here?

885
00:38:32,830 --> 00:38:33,823
I have Liren's lunch.

886
00:38:34,411 --> 00:38:34,946
Where is he?

887
00:38:35,095 --> 00:38:35,715
In his office.

888
00:38:35,821 --> 00:38:36,501
Let me tell him.

889
00:38:37,060 --> 00:38:37,461
Ms. Hui,

890
00:38:37,821 --> 00:38:38,781
wait a second, please.

891
00:38:39,060 --> 00:38:40,060
Let me tell him.

892
00:38:40,580 --> 00:38:40,981
Ms. Hui.

893
00:38:44,781 --> 00:38:45,861
Back to work, everyone.

894
00:38:59,941 --> 00:39:00,781
You had a guest?

895
00:39:02,220 --> 00:39:02,660
Yes.

896
00:39:03,220 --> 00:39:04,379
I get visitors all the time.

897
00:39:04,941 --> 00:39:05,501
Just now,

898
00:39:05,660 --> 00:39:06,381
at the front desk,

899
00:39:06,381 --> 00:39:07,660
I saw a man in a black jacket.

900
00:39:08,060 --> 00:39:08,932
He looked familiar.

901
00:39:09,700 --> 00:39:10,260
Was it him?

902
00:39:10,660 --> 00:39:11,501
A black jacket?

903
00:39:12,620 --> 00:39:14,169
I didn't see anyone in a black jacket.

904
00:39:15,981 --> 00:39:17,540
I told you not to bring me lunch.

905
00:39:18,301 --> 00:39:19,501
Come to the office less often.

906
00:39:20,381 --> 00:39:20,861
What?

907
00:39:21,821 --> 00:39:22,719
Am I embarrassing you?

908
00:39:23,660 --> 00:39:24,580
Does marrying

909
00:39:24,620 --> 00:39:25,901
an unpresentable housekeeper

910
00:39:26,060 --> 00:39:27,140
ruin your reputation?

911
00:39:29,540 --> 00:39:30,421
It's not about that.

912
00:39:31,620 --> 00:39:32,781
Given Jiali's situation now,

913
00:39:33,501 --> 00:39:34,421
announcing the marriage

914
00:39:34,501 --> 00:39:35,234
wouldn't be wise.

915
00:39:39,540 --> 00:39:40,021
What?

916
00:39:41,180 --> 00:39:42,052
Don't touch my coat.

917
00:39:44,616 --> 00:39:47,592
(Marriage Certificate)

918
00:39:50,504 --> 00:39:53,224
=The Vanishing Beauty=
(Next Episode Preview)

919
00:39:53,981 --> 00:39:54,580
Hui,

920
00:39:54,981 --> 00:39:56,140
you're my wife now.

921
00:39:57,021 --> 00:39:57,700
You don't need

922
00:39:58,021 --> 00:39:58,941
to do these anymore.

923
00:40:00,901 --> 00:40:02,461
Following this lead,

924
00:40:02,821 --> 00:40:04,341
I found the newspaper from back then.

925
00:40:05,180 --> 00:40:06,821
It clearly said that Lu Zhiming,

926
00:40:08,600 --> 00:40:09,941
owner of Hongli Garment Factory,

927
00:40:09,941 --> 00:40:11,180
was killed in a car crash,

928
00:40:11,461 --> 00:40:12,861
while the suspect, surnamed Peng,

929
00:40:13,021 --> 00:40:14,501
(Factory Owner Lu Zhiming Killed in Crash)
was let go due to insufficient evidence.

930
00:40:16,620 --> 00:40:17,821
Why are you following me?

931
00:40:18,861 --> 00:40:20,060
Did you remarry Di Liren

932
00:40:21,140 --> 00:40:21,941
because of him?

933
00:40:23,580 --> 00:40:24,781
So Peng Cheng is connected

934
00:40:25,660 --> 00:40:26,620
to your father's death?

935
00:40:41,832 --> 00:40:46,701
♪Old dreams have faded in color♪

936
00:40:49,185 --> 00:40:54,048
♪A lonely heart torn in conflict♪

937
00:40:56,506 --> 00:41:01,351
♪The love that stumbled along♪

938
00:41:01,796 --> 00:41:08,298
♪Was just a quiet release♪

939
00:41:11,030 --> 00:41:17,983
♪I write the future into a song,
honoring the brave with no regrets♪

940
00:41:18,533 --> 00:41:24,463
♪Turning all losses
into the passion of this moment♪

941
00:41:25,587 --> 00:41:32,818
♪I write the future into a song,
for the me who never walks away♪

942
00:41:33,121 --> 00:41:38,294
♪Forging all weaknesses
into sharp, bold colors♪

943
00:41:38,914 --> 00:41:50,382
♪In this life,
I follow only my own choice♪

944
00:41:52,882 --> 00:41:58,130
♪The chilled night has lost its color♪

945
00:42:00,171 --> 00:42:05,606
♪No need to echo those
who drifted apart♪

946
00:42:07,428 --> 00:42:12,825
♪No longer proving my worth to anyone♪

947
00:42:12,825 --> 00:42:21,470
♪The answer has long been etched
in my silhouette♪

948
00:42:21,946 --> 00:42:29,509
♪I write the future into a song,
for the me who never walks away♪

949
00:42:29,509 --> 00:42:35,355
♪Paving every twist and turn
into a path forward♪

950
00:42:35,355 --> 00:42:45,522
♪The ending of this life
will be set by me♪

